{"archetypes":[{"name":"env-boundary","focus_area":"correctness","weight":1,"rationale":"Fresh Bash boundaries and durable session-env rehydration are the root-cause seam most likely to be under-specified.","prompt_body":"Investigate whether the plan fully closes the fresh Bash call boundary that caused empty presence values. Compare the proposed /implement, /design, and shared-reviewer wording against the actual durable session-env and prelude-sourcing mechanisms. Look for missing resume-path handling, wrong variable source assumptions, or plan text that still implies ambient shell inheritance. Cite specific file paths and line ranges for any issues found, and follow the output-format rules from your outer wrapper exactly."},{"name":"gate-contract","focus_area":"risk-integration","weight":1,"rationale":"The gate is a detector with stdout, stderr, and exit-code contracts that can drift under diagnostic changes.","prompt_body":"Review the plan against the existing degraded-tools-gate contract and harness expectations. Check whether the new empty-presence signal preserves valid-input stdout byte compatibility, exit-code behavior, omitted-flag warnings, explanation markers, and binary-found tristate semantics. Hunt for places where the plan may accidentally change classification semantics rather than only adding a bug-class diagnostic. Cite specific file paths and line ranges for any issues found, and follow the output-format rules from your outer wrapper exactly."},{"name":"harness-pins","focus_area":"code-quality","weight":1,"rationale":"This change relies on structural and behavioral tests to prevent prompt-surface regressions across shell and markdown files.","prompt_body":"Evaluate whether the proposed tests and structural pins actually prove the intended rehydration behavior and empty-input diagnostics. Compare the test plan to existing harness style, Makefile registration, shard documentation, and grep fragility risks. Look for missing negative cases, unpinned cross-doc drift, or tests that assert prose without guaranteeing the executable call shape. Cite specific file paths and line ranges for any issues found, and follow the output-format rules from your outer wrapper exactly."}]}
